GRPC and REST uses HTTP protocol grpc provides low latency and increased performance in terms of internal communication between the micro services.
gRPC, Protocol Buffers (Protobuf) format it is like json in HTTP but here it is in binary format and more efficient.
PROTO FILE
The proto file is like something which defines the methods present in the Service and the response and the request format its name is similar to the Service itself. Helps in interacting with each other microservices like it sets up the gRPC server and the gRPC client. In this lot of other microservices like appointment service just needs to use proto file of billing service so it regenerates teh code needed for communication between the appointment and billing through gRPC server and client.


